      "comment": "PRETTY BOY FLOYD (8) is an honest type rarely out of the money, scoring at Goulburn (24.69) last time and making it five straight wins. Has the ability and expected to prove tough to beat again. NEW SURPRISE (1) has been hard to follow lately, running eighth (30.55) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Richmond. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Expected to do much better this time. RILEY DOZER (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (30.29) in a Grade 5 at this track. The form out of last race has been strong. Expected to run well. FORTY'S BOY (7) is right in the mix.",
